1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,289
For hydrogen and iodine, the activated complex is a square of four atoms.

2
00:00:06,289 --> 00:00:12,200
The H H bond and the I I bond stretch, while two new H I bonds start to form.

3
00:00:12,200 --> 00:00:16,562
Then it falls apart into two molecules of hydrogen iodide.

